  "prefLabel": "En 708.02 E-16 Report of Sewer Meter Complaint Tests",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 708.02 E-16 Report of Sewer Meter Complaint Tests.\n\n(a) Each sewer utility shall report by completing and submitting department “Form E-16, Report of Sewer Meter Complaint Tests,” revised March 2024, available on the department’s website at www.energy.nh.gov, to the department monthly if water or sewer meter complaints occur, the former if the sewage service is being measured by the water meter.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en700.html"
